    "Opens Mactivity's Projects tab to review dev servers that have gone idle. Stopping them happens in Mactivity, after it asks." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Öffnet in Mactivity den Tab „Projekte“, um inaktive Dev-Server zu prüfen. Beendet werden sie in Mactivity, nach einer Rückfrage."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Abre la pestaña Proyectos de Mactivity para revisar los servidores de desarrollo que se han quedado inactivos. Se detienen en Mactivity, tras pedirte confirmación."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ouvre l’onglet Projets de Mactivity pour passer en revue les serveurs de dev inactifs. Leur arrêt se fait dans Mactivity, après confirmation."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apre la scheda Progetti di Mactivity per controllare i server di sviluppo diventati inattivi. L'arresto avviene in Mactivity, dopo una conferma."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mactivityの“プロジェクト”タブを開いて、アイドル状態になった開発サーバを確認します。停止はMactivityで確認を求められたあとに行われます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mactivity의 프로젝트 탭을 열어 유휴 상태가 된 개발 서버를 검토합니다. 중지는 Mactivity에서 확인을 거친 후에 이루어집니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Opent het tabblad Projecten van Mactivity om inactieve devservers te bekijken. Stoppen gebeurt in Mactivity, nadat het om bevestiging vraagt."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Abre a aba Projetos do Mactivity para revisar os servidores dev que ficaram ociosos. Eles só são parados no Mactivity, depois de ele perguntar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开 Mactivity 的“项目”标签页以查看已闲置的开发服务器。停止操作在 Mactivity 中进行，并会先征得你的确认。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打開 Mactivity 的「專案」標籤頁以查看已閒置的開發伺服器。停止動作會在 Mactivity 中進行，並會先詢問你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
